2026-11-06T03:02:10.3706560Z 
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3706923Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3707285Z 
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3707600Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
