2026-11-06T03:02:10.3712591Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3712997Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3713284Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3713579Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3713998Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3714367Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3718380Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3719324Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3728415Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3729284Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:02:10.3729584Z 
